1
00:00:01,139 --> 00:00:02,819
If you're twenty-five and skint,

2
00:00:02,819 --> 00:00:03,680
listen to an old man

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:04,580
for thirty seconds.

4
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:06,660
I was skint.

5
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,359
January 1983, we couldn't

6
00:00:08,359 --> 00:00:09,460
pay the gas bill,

7
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,980
and I was a plumber.

8
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,160
A plumber.

9
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,859
So I bought a notebook,

10
00:00:13,859 --> 00:00:15,560
ten pence, wrote down

11
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:17,260
every penny for one month,

12
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:17,719
and I didn't

13
00:00:17,719 --> 00:00:18,879
change a thing.

14
00:00:18,879 --> 00:00:20,039
I just looked.

15
00:00:20,039 --> 00:00:21,199
That's the bit people skip.

16
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:22,879
They want the plan

17
00:00:22,879 --> 00:00:23,660
before they've looked.

18
00:00:24,839 --> 00:00:27,140
Look first, love. It'll hurt.

19
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:28,019
Then it stops hurting.

